  "id": "BIT-ghost-2026-103281",
  "summary": "Ghost 3.23.0 before 6.23.0 API Key Exposure via Admin API",
  "details": "Ghost (npm package 'ghost') versions from 3.23.0 up to, but not including, 6.23.0 expose API keys to users with low-privilege staff accounts. An authenticated low-privilege staff user can read API keys returned by the Admin API, which are intended to be available only to higher-privileged users.",
